[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6301.35, "timestamp": "01:45:01", "text": "那。你变成了一只猫，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6302.709, "timestamp": "01:45:02", "text": "这就是整部动画的内容。但他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6305.83, "timestamp": "01:45:05", "text": "打算和那个人合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6307.91, "timestamp": "01:45:07", "text": "动漫里好像还有个虚拟主播（VTuber）。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6310.31, "timestamp": "01:45:10", "text": "合作消息公布。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6312.149, "timestamp": "01:45:12", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6316.149, "timestamp": "01:45:16", "text": "该死。疯狂的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6320.07, "timestamp": "01:45:20", "text": "是的，这款游戏有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6325.99, "timestamp": "01:45:25", "text": "嗯，但是你玩的时候，我们按下准备键。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6328.229, "timestamp": "01:45:28", "text": "是的。准备好了，我们就会到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6331.27, "timestamp": "01:45:31", "text": "就像一个更新的大厅，但就像我们只会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6333.51, "timestamp": "01:45:33", "text": "点击这里开始播放。我不会说脏话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6335.27, "timestamp": "01:45:35", "text": "任何事物。我们就让它这样吧，我们这就走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6337.75, "timestamp": "01:45:37", "text": "轻松随意地玩玩，然后自己摸索。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6344.87, "timestamp": "01:45:44", "text": "为什么我觉得我的进步和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6347.59, "timestamp": "01:45:47", "text": "所有东西都重置了吗？我以前玩过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6350.95, "timestamp": "01:45:50", "text": "一两次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6355.59, "timestamp": "01:45:55", "text": "很可能确实如此。或许有"}]